	)
	(text "It is also possible to connect the VOCM input to a \ncommon-mode level (CML) output of an ADC. However, \ncare must be taken to ensure that the output has \nsufficient drive capability. The input impedance of \nthe VOCM pin is approximately 250 kΩ."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 180.594 70.358 0)
